new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ec755e9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/kwrt-integration.md
@@ -0,0 +1,71 @@
+# 把改后的 QModem 编入 Kwrt / OpenWrt / ImmortalWrt 固件
+
+目标：在 kiddin9/Kwrt（或你的 fork）构建出的固件里，包含带 `antenna_signal` 方法的 QModem，
+供 M28C（Widora MangoPi，RM520N-GL 5G 模组）的"天线信号实时可视化 + 历史记录"前端调用。
+
+## 1. 维护一个 QModem fork / 分支
+
+上游 `FUjr/QModem` 是 MPL-2.0 + 禁止商用的附加条款（见仓库 LICENSE）。本改动是增量、向后兼容，
+建议：
+
+1. Fork `FUjr/QModem` 到你账号，例如 `you/QModem`。
+2. 把本目录（含 `antenna_signal` 方法、`cmd_qrsp/qsrq/qscp/qrsgr` 封装、文档）提交到该 fork 的一个分支，例如 `feat/antenna-signal`。
+3. 后续同步上游时 rebase 该分支即可，改动不会与 `info`/`network_info`/`send_at` 冲突。
+
+## 2. 在 Kwrt 的 diy.sh / feeds 里加 feed 指向你的 fork
+
+在构建系统的 `devices/<target>/diy.sh`（或公共 `devices/common/diy.sh`）里，把原来的：
+
+```sh
+# 原（指向上游）
+echo "src-git qmodem https://github.com/FUjr/QModem.git;main" >> feeds.conf.default
+```
+
+改成指向你的分支（带 `antenna_signal`）：
+
+```sh
+# 改后（指向你的 fork + 分支）
+sed -i '/src-git qmodem/d' feeds.conf.default
+echo "src-git qmodem https://github.com/you/QModem.git;feat/antenna-signal" >> feeds.conf.default
+./scripts/feeds update qmodem
+./scripts/feeds install -a -p qmodem
+```
+
+> M28C 目标（`devices/m28c/`）的 `settings.ini` 已经把 `REPO_URL` 指向 `immortalwrt/immortalwrt`，
+> 上面的 feed 改动在两个源码树下都生效（ImmortalWrt 同样支持 QModem 的 `src-git` feed）。
+
+## 3. 确保相关内核模块被编入（5G 模组必需）
+
+在目标 `.config` 里开启（网页勾选或写死）：
+
+```sh
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-app-qmodem-next=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_qmodem=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-net-qmi-wwan=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-net-cdc-mbim=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-serial-option=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-serial-wwan=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_proto-qmi=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_proto-mbim=y
+# RM520N-GL 是 PCIe(M.2) 模组，需要 MHI 驱动
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-mhi-pci-generic=y
+```
+
+## 4. 前端调用（两种写法）
+
+### 方案 B（推荐，固件已含本改动）
+```sh
+ubus call qmodem antenna_signal '{"config_section":"modem1"}'
+```
+前端定时（如 1s）轮询此接口，直接拿到 4 路天线 RSRP/RSRQ/SINR + 速率因子，落历史日志即可。
+
+### 方案 A（不刷固件、仅加 CGI）
+把 `examples/at_rsrp.cgi` 放到路由 `/www/cgi-bin/at_rsrp` 并 `chmod +x`，前端 GET
+`/cgi-bin/at_rsrp?modem1` 得到同构 JSON。前提是固件已含原版 QModem（`send_at` 存在）。
+
+## 5. 验收要点
+- `ubus call qmodem antenna_signal '{"config_section":"modem1"}'` 返回 4 路数组、bandwidth_mhz、ca_count、mimo_rank。
+- RSQR/QRSCP 已是 ÷10 后的 dB（非 0.1dB 原始值）。
+- 1 秒级连续调用无空读、无端口竞争（所有 AT 走 tom_modem 托管通道）。
+- NSA(ENDC) 与 SA(NR5G) 下均正确解析 NR 段。
+- 原 `info` / `network_info` / `send_at` / LuCI 页面不受影响。
diff --git a/docs/qmodem-rpcd-interface.md b/docs/qmodem-rpcd-interface.md
index c60e619..b58d2dd 100644
--- a/docs/qmodem-rpcd-interface.md
+++ b/docs/qmodem-rpcd-interface.md
@@ -476,3 +476,47 @@ ubus call qmodem info '{"config_section":"modem1"}'
 - The config_section must exist in `/etc/config/qmodem`
 - Vendor-specific functionality is loaded from `/usr/share/qmodem/vendor/` based on the modem manufacturer
 - AT command language (Chinese/English) is automatically selected based on system language settings
+
+## antenna_signal (Real-time per-antenna signal + rate factors)
+
+Returns per-antenna RSRP/RSRQ/SINR plus rate-shaping factors (bandwidth, CA count, MIMO
+rank, band, PCI, netmode/rat) for antenna placement / tuning dashboards and time-series logging.
+
+This method is **real-time**: it does NOT use the 10-second cache used by `info` / `network_info`.
+All AT queries are sent through the managed `tom_modem` channel (the `cmd_*` wrappers), so it
+never opens `/dev/tty*` directly and does not contend with QModem's own polling.
+
+### Request
+```bash
+ubus call qmodem antenna_signal '{"config_section":"modem1"}'
+```
+
+### Response (example, Quectel RM520N-GL, ENDC)
+```json
+{
+  "config_section": "modem1",
+  "timestamp": 1762135800,
+  "antenna_rsrp": [-74, -75, -99, -76],
+  "antenna_rsrq": [-12.1, -12.5, -14.0, -13.0],
+  "antenna_sinr": [21.0, 18.0, 5.0, 12.0],
+  "netmode": "ENDC",
+  "rat": "NR5G",
+  "band": "78",
+  "pci": "123",
+  "bandwidth_mhz": 100,
+  "ca_count": 2,
+  "mimo_rank": 4
+}
+```
+
+### Field notes
+- `antenna_rsrp` / `antenna_rsrq` / `antenna_sinr` are arrays of up to 4 values (MAIN/DIV/MIMO1/MIMO2).
+  Missing or unsupported antennas are emitted as `""`.
+- `antenna_rsrq` and `antenna_sinr` are reported in **dB**; the raw 0.1 dB values from `+QRSRQ` / `+QRSCP`
+  are divided by 10 before returning.
+- SINR source is `+QRSCP` when available; otherwise it falls back to the aggregate NR SINR from `+QENG`.
+- `ca_count` counts PCC + SCC carriers parsed from `+QCAINFO`.
+- `mimo_rank` comes from `+QRSGR`.
+- Only Quectel modems that implement `+QRSRP`/`+QRSRQ`/`+QRSCP`/`+QRSGR` (e.g. RM520N-GL) populate the
+  per-antenna arrays; on other modems those arrays will be empty and the call still returns the
+  aggregate `netmode`/`rat`/`bandwidth_mhz` derived from `+QENG` / `+QCAINFO`.
diff --git a/examples/at_rsrp.cgi b/examples/at_rsrp.cgi
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8f04252
--- /dev/null
+++ b/examples/at_rsrp.cgi
@@ -0,0 +1,101 @@
+#!/bin/sh
+# /www/cgi-bin/at_rsrp  --  方案A: 经 ubus send_at 取分路信号，绝不直开 /dev/tty*
+# 配合 QModem 使用；部署: 放到路由 /www/cgi-bin/at_rsrp, chmod +x, 依赖 jq
+#
+# 调用:  http://<router>/cgi-bin/at_rsrp?modem1
+# 返回:  与 ubus qmodem antenna_signal 同构的 JSON
+
+echo "Content-Type: application/json"
+echo ""
+
+SECTION="${QUERY_STRING%%=*}"
+[ -z "$SECTION" ] && SECTION="modem1"
+
+# 经 QModem 托管通道透传 AT，返回响应文本
+q() {
+    ubus call qmodem send_at "{\"config_section\":\"$SECTION\",\"params\":{\"at\":\"$1\"}}" \
+        | jq -r '.at_cfg.res // empty'
+}
+
+qrsp=$(q "AT+QRSRP?")
+qsrq=$(q "AT+QRSRQ?")
+qscp=$(q "AT+QRSCP?")
+qeng=$(q 'AT+QENG="servingcell"')
+qcainfo=$(q "AT+QCAINFO")
+qrsgr=$(q "AT+QRSGR?")
+
+arr4() {  # $1=line(+QXXX: a,b,c,d,...)  $2=label
+    local line="$1" f i v
+    line=$(echo "$line" | sed "s/^+$2: //; s/\r//g; s/ //g")
+    for i in 1 2 3 4; do
+        v=$(echo "$line" | awk -F',' -v f=$i '{print $f}')
+        if [ -n "$v" ] && [ "$v" != "-" ]; then printf '%s' "$v"; else printf '""'; fi
+        [ $i -lt 4 ] && printf ','
+    done
+}
+div10() {  # 0.1dB -> dB, 4 路
+    local line="$1" f v
+    line=$(echo "$line" | sed 's/^+[A-Z]*: //; s/\r//g; s/ //g')
+    for i in 1 2 3 4; do
+        v=$(echo "$line" | awk -F',' -v f=$i '{print $f}')
+        if [ -n "$v" ] && [ "$v" != "-" ]; then awk "BEGIN{printf \"%.1f\", $v/10}"; else printf '""'; fi
+        [ $i -lt 4 ] && printf ','
+    done
+}
+
+rsrp=$(arr4 "$(echo "$qrsp" | grep '+QRSRP:' | head -n1)" "QRSRP")
+rsrq=$(div10 "$(echo "$qsrq" | grep '+QRSRQ:' | head -n1)")
+scp_line=$(echo "$qscp" | grep '+QRSCP:' | head -n1)
+if [ -n "$scp_line" ]; then
+    sinr=$(div10 "$scp_line")
+else
+    ns=$(echo "$qeng" | grep '+QENG: "NR5G-NSA"'); sa=$(echo "$qeng" | grep '+QENG: "NR5G-SA"')
+    n=$( [ -n "$ns" ] && echo "$ns" | awk -F',' '{print $6}' || echo "$sa" | awk -F',' '{print $12}' )
+    s=""
+    for i in 1 2 3 4; do
+        [ -n "$n" ] && [ "$n" != "-" ] && s="${s}$(awk "BEGIN{printf \"%.1f\", $n/10}")" || s="${s}\"\""
+        [ $i -lt 4 ] && s="${s},"
+    done
+    sinr="$s"
+fi
+
+lte=$(echo "$qeng" | grep '+QENG: "LTE"')
+nsa=$(echo "$qeng" | grep '+QENG: "NR5G-NSA"')
+sa=$(echo "$qeng" | grep '+QENG: "NR5G-SA"')
+if [ -n "$lte" ] && [ -n "$nsa" ]; then netmode=ENDC; rat=NR5G
+elif [ -n "$sa" ]; then netmode=SA; rat=NR5G
+elif [ -n "$lte" ]; then netmode=LTE; rat=LTE
+else netmode=UNKNOWN; rat=UNKNOWN; fi
+
+band=""; pci=""
+if [ -n "$nsa" ]; then band=$(echo "$nsa" | awk -F',' '{print $9}'); pci=$(echo "$nsa" | awk -F',' '{print $4}')
+elif [ -n "$sa" ]; then band=$(echo "$sa" | awk -F',' '{print $11}'); pci=$(echo "$sa" | awk -F',' '{print $8}'); fi
+
+bw_num=$(echo "$qcainfo" | grep '+QCAINFO:' | grep PCC | awk -F',' '{print $3}' | head -n1)
+bw_mhz=""
+[ -n "$bw_num" ] && bw_mhz=$(echo "$bw_num" | awk '{ if($1 ~ /^[0-9]+$/) print $1*5+5; else print "" }')
+[ -z "$bw_mhz" ] && bw_mhz="\"\""
+
+ca_count=0
+echo "$qcainfo" | grep -q '+QCAINFO:' && ca_count=$(echo "$qcainfo" | grep '+QCAINFO:' | grep -E 'PCC|SCC' | wc -l)
+[ "$ca_count" -lt 1 ] && ca_count=1
+
+rank=$(echo "$qrsgr" | grep '+QRSGR:' | head -n1 | sed 's/+QRSGR: //; s/\r//g; s/ //g' | awk -F',' '{print $1}')
+[ -z "$rank" ] && rank=0
+
+cat <<EOF
+{
+  "config_section": "$SECTION",
+  "timestamp": $(date +%s),
+  "antenna_rsrp": [$rsrp],
+  "antenna_rsrq": [$rsrq],
+  "antenna_sinr": [$sinr],
+  "netmode": "$netmode",
+  "rat": "$rat",
+  "band": "$band",
+  "pci": "$pci",
+  "bandwidth_mhz": $bw_mhz,
+  "ca_count": $ca_count,
+  "mimo_rank": $rank
+}
+EOF
